qbone (1.6.0-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * Build on Debian 13 with the remoteproc PRU backend.
  * Enable the services on installation, so an installed package is a
    running emulator.
  * Declare the network tools qbone-network and qbone-setup call.
  * Ask for an admin password on first use of the web interface and keep it
    in the settings file.

